'''Rawhide''' (カウボーイ, ''Kaubōi'', '''Cowboy''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 4.0 Update|Version 4.0]].

==Effect==
Unit Speed UP (Sm): Cats' movement speed increases by 10%.

